module Core

### Represents the success-or-crash carrier used by `check_` routines.
### A `Result[T]` stores either a successful `T` payload or a crashable error
### payload inline. The full layout is codegen-controlled:
###   { U64 type_id, [max(sizeof(T), 8) x U8] payload }
### `type_id == 0` is the Blank state with don't-care payload bytes.
### :typeparam T: The successful return value type.
record Result[T]
  ### Identifies the stored payload type.
  ### The runtime uses this to distinguish successful payloads from crashables.
  secret type_id: U64